    <main id="top"><header class="nav-wrap"><nav class="nav shell" aria-label="Main navigation"><a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="VirtualPortal home"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><span class="signal">))</span><span class="play">▶</span><span class="live-dot"></span></span><span><b>Virtual</b><strong>Portal</strong><small>LIVE • CONNECT • ENGAGE</small></span></a><div class="nav-links"><a href="#features">Features</a><a href="#solutions">Solutions</a><a href="#process">How it works</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></div><a class="button button-small" href="#contact">Book a demo <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></nav></header><section class="hero shell"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="pulse"></span> Built for professional virtual &amp; hybrid events</div><h1>One powerful portal for your <em>entire event.</em></h1><p class="hero-lead">Create branded event pages, collect registrations, stream live, engage your audience and access complete reports—all through one unique event link.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#contact">Book a free demo <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="#features">Explore features <span>↓</span></a></div><ul class="trust-list"><li><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"></path></svg> Custom branding</li><li><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"></path></svg> No app download</li><li><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"></path></svg> Dedicated support</li></ul></div><div class="hero-visual" aria-label="VirtualPortal event dashboard preview"><div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="dashboard-card"><div class="browser-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>virtualportal.in/medical-summit</span></div><div class="event-head"><div class="mini-logo">VP</div><div><small>LIVE EVENT</small><h3>Healthcare Innovation Summit</h3></div><span class="live-pill">● LIVE</span></div><div class="event-grid"><div class="video-frame"><div class="stage-light"></div><div class="speaker"><span class="speaker-head"></span><span class="speaker-body"></span></div><button aria-label="Play event stream">▶</button><div class="video-caption"><b>Future of Connected Healthcare</b><span>Dr. A. Sharma • Keynote</span></div></div><div class="side-panel"><div class="tabs"><b>Q&amp;A</b><span>Polls</span></div><div class="question"><i>RS</i><p><b>Rahul S.</b><span>How will AI improve patient care?</span></p></div><div class="question"><i>KM</i><p><b>Kavya M.</b><span>Can you share implementation examples?</span></p></div><div class="ask">Ask a question… <span>↑</span></div></div></div><div class="stats-row"><div><b>1,248</b><span>Registered</span></div><div><b>846</b><span>Watching live</span></div><div><b>68%</b><span>Engagement</span></div><div><b>4.8/5</b><span>Event rating</span></div></div></div><div class="float-card float-one"><span>✓</span><p><b>Registration confirmed</b><small>Welcome to the event</small></p></div><div class="float-card float-two"><span>↗</span><p><b>+142 attendees</b><small>in the last hour</small></p></div></div></section><section class="logo-strip"><div class="shell proof-row"><p>Designed for events that cannot afford to feel ordinary</p><div><span>PHARMA</span><span>HEALTHCARE</span><span>CORPORATE</span><span>ASSOCIATIONS</span><span>EDUCATION</span></div></div></section><section class="section intro" id="features"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head centered"><span class="section-label">ONE CONNECTED PLATFORM</span><h2>Everything your event needs.<br/><em>Nothing your team doesn&#x27;t.</em></h2><p>Replace scattered forms, streaming links and spreadsheets with one professionally managed event experience.</p></div><div class="feature-grid"><article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">↗</div><h3>Branded Event Microsite</h3><p>Give every event its own digital identity with your logo, banners, colours, speakers, agenda and sponsors.</p><div class="microsite-preview" aria-hidden="true"><div class="microsite-notch"></div><div class="microsite-browser"><span>virtualportal.in/event</span></div><div class="microsite-cover"><small>YOUR LOGO</small><b>Annual Leadership Summit 2026</b><span>12 September • 10:00 AM</span><em>Register now</em></div></div></article><article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">＋</div><h3>Custom Registration</h3><p>Capture the exact attendee information your event requires with flexible registration fields and approval workflows.</p><ul><li><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"></path></svg> Custom fields</li><li><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"></path></svg> Approval controls</li><li><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"></path></svg> Data export</li></ul></article><article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">▶</div><h3>Professional Live Streaming</h3><p>Embed YouTube Live or a supported player directly inside your event page for a seamless branded viewing experience.</p><div class="stream-status"><span><i></i> STREAM READY</span><b>1080p HD</b></div></article><article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">?</div><h3>Live Q&amp;A and Polls</h3><p>Turn viewers into participants with moderated questions, real-time polling, announcements and feedback.</p><div class="poll-mini"><b>Which session was most valuable?</b><span><i style="width:76%"></i>Keynote <em>76%</em></span><span><i style="width:52%"></i>Panel <em>52%</em></span></div></article><article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">▥</div><h3>Client Dashboard</h3><p>Give authorised teams secure access to registrations, attendee questions, poll responses and event information.</p><div class="dashboard-mini"><span><b>2,480</b><small>Total registrations</small></span><span><b>+18%</b><small>This week</small></span></div></article><article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">↧</div><h3>Reports and Replay</h3><p>Export useful event data and keep the same page active for secure replay or on-demand viewing after the event.</p><div class="file-pills"><span>CSV</span><span>XLS</span><span>PDF</span><span>REPLAY</span></div></article></div></div></section><section class="portal-showcase" aria-labelledby="portal-showcase-heading"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head centered portal-showcase-head"><span class="section-label">SEE THE PORTAL IN ACTION</span><h2 id="portal-showcase-heading">One platform. Three powerful<br/><em>event experiences.</em></h2><p>Manage every event centrally, deliver an engaging live experience and turn audience activity into useful reports.</p></div><div class="portal-screen-grid"><figure class="portal-screen portal-screen-wide"><div class="screen-bar"><span>01</span><b>Event Management</b><small>Manage organisations, events and registrations</small></div><img src="assets/event live.png" alt="VirtualPortal super admin dashboard showing event metrics and upcoming live events" width="1568" height="1003" loading="lazy"/></figure><figure class="portal-screen"><div class="screen-bar"><span>02</span><b>Live Event Experience</b><small>Stream, Q&amp;A, polls and agenda in one place</small></div><img src="assets/virtualportal-live-event-new.png" alt="VirtualPortal live healthcare event page with video stream, questions and event agenda" width="1586" height="992" loading="lazy"/></figure><figure class="portal-screen"><div class="screen-bar"><span>03</span><b>Reports &amp; Analytics</b><small>Track registrations, attendance and engagement</small></div><img src="assets/report.png" alt="VirtualPortal event analytics dashboard with registrations, attendance and engagement reports" width="1586" height="992" loading="lazy"/></figure></div></div></section><section class="section unique-section"><div class="shell unique-grid"><div class="unique-copy"><span class="section-label light">A LINK AS UNIQUE AS YOUR EVENT</span><h2>One link. Every touchpoint.</h2><p>From the first invitation to the final replay, your audience stays inside one consistent, branded experience.</p><div class="journey-list"><div><b>01</b><span><strong>Share</strong><small>WhatsApp, email, ads or website</small></span></div><div><b>02</b><span><strong>Register</strong><small>Custom form and confirmation</small></span></div><div><b>03</b><span><strong>Join live</strong><small>Browser-based event access</small></span></div><div><b>04</b><span><strong>Replay</strong><small>On-demand after the event</small></span></div></div></div><div class="phone-wrap"><div class="link-chip">🔒 virtualportal.in/<b>pharma-summit-2026</b></div><div class="phone"><div class="phone-notch"></div><div class="mobile-banner"><span>HEALTH FORWARD</span><b>Pharma Innovation<br/>Summit 2026</b><small>20 October • 9:30 AM</small></div><div class="mobile-count"><span><b>08</b><small>Days</small></span><span><b>14</b><small>Hours</small></span><span><b>22</b><small>Mins</small></span></div><div class="mobile-form"><b>Register to attend</b><span>Full name</span><span>Email address</span><button>Register &amp; join →</button></div></div></div></div></section><section class="visual-showcase" aria-labelledby="event-visuals-heading"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head split visual-heading"><div><span class="section-label">REAL EVENTS. PROFESSIONAL DELIVERY.</span><h2 id="event-visuals-heading">Technology built for<br/><em>events in action.</em></h2></div><p>From scientific conferences to hybrid corporate events, VirtualPortal connects professional production with a seamless online audience experience.</p></div><div class="event-photo-grid"><figure class="event-photo event-photo-large"><img src="assets/medical-pharma-conference.png" alt="Professional medical and pharmaceutical conference in a modern auditorium" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy"/><figcaption><span>01</span><div><b>Medical &amp; Pharma Conferences</b><small>Scientific sessions, HCP engagement and secure registration.</small></div></figcaption></figure><figure class="event-photo"><img src="assets/corporate-hybrid-event.png" alt="Corporate hybrid event with an on-stage speaker and remote participants" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy"/><figcaption><span>02</span><div><b>Corporate Hybrid Events</b><small>One experience for physical and online audiences.</small></div></figcaption></figure><figure class="event-photo"><img src="assets/live-stream-production.png" alt="Professional conference live-stream production with camera and video switcher" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy"/><figcaption><span>03</span><div><b>Live-Stream Production</b><small>Professional cameras, switching and event-day support.</small></div></figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class="section" id="solutions"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head split"><div><span class="section-label">MADE FOR PROFESSIONAL EVENTS</span><h2>Built around your<br/><em>audience and industry.</em></h2></div><p>VirtualPortal adapts to the registration, branding and reporting needs of every professional event format.</p></div><div class="solution-grid"><article><span>✚</span><h3>Medical &amp; Pharma</h3><p>HCP registration, speciality data, scientific sessions, moderated Q&amp;A and post-event reports.</p><a href="#contact">Explore solution <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></article><article><span>▦</span><h3>Corporate Events</h3><p>Town halls, annual meetings, training, dealer meets, leadership sessions and product launches.</p><a href="#contact">Explore solution <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></article><article><span>◎</span><h3>Hybrid Conferences</h3><p>Connect physical and online audiences with professional multi-camera streaming and engagement.</p><a href="#contact">Explore solution <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></article><article><span>◇</span><h3>Event Agencies</h3><p>Deliver a white-label digital experience while managing multiple client events and reports centrally.</p><a href="#contact">Explore solution <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></article></div></div></section><section class="section process-section" id="process"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head centered"><span class="section-label">SIMPLE FROM DAY ONE</span><h2>From brief to broadcast<br/><em>in four clear steps.</em></h2></div><div class="process-grid"><article><b>01</b><span>Tell us about your event</span><p>Share the format, date, audience, branding and registration requirements.</p></article><article><b>02</b><span>We create your portal</span><p>Your event link, page, form and streaming experience are configured and tested.</p></article><article><b>03</b><span>Promote and go live</span><p>Share one link everywhere. Attendees register and join directly from their browser.</p></article><article><b>04</b><span>Receive reports &amp; replay</span><p>Access registration data, engagement insights and on-demand event viewing.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section faq-section" id="faq"><div class="shell faq-grid"><div><span class="section-label">QUESTIONS, ANSWERED</span><h2>Everything you need to know.</h2><p>Still have a question? Our team can help you plan the right digital experience for your event.</p><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Talk to an event expert <span>→</span></a></div><div class="faq-list"><details open=""><summary>Does every event receive a separate link?<b>＋</b></summary><p>Yes. Every event gets a unique, shareable URL such as virtualportal.in/event-name.</p></details><details><summary>Can the event page use our branding?<b>＋</b></summary><p>Yes. We can include your logo, banners, colours, speakers, agenda, sponsors and custom event information.</p></details><details><summary>Can attendees join from a mobile phone?<b>＋</b></summary><p>Yes. The portal works through modern mobile, tablet, laptop and desktop browsers with no app download required.</p></details><details><summary>Does VirtualPortal support YouTube Live?<b>＋</b></summary><p>Yes. YouTube Live can be embedded within the branded event page. Other supported players can be configured as required.</p></details><details><summary>Will we receive registration data and reports?<b>＋</b></summary><p>Yes. Authorised clients can view and export relevant registration and engagement data.</p></details><details><summary>Can the event be available after it ends?<b>＋</b></summary><p>Yes. The same link can be converted into a secure replay or on-demand event page.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="contact-section" id="contact"><div class="shell contact-grid"><div class="contact-copy"><span class="section-label light">LET&#x27;S BUILD YOUR NEXT EVENT</span><h2>Ready to create an event people remember?</h2><p>Tell us what you are planning. Our team will recommend the right portal, streaming and engagement setup for your audience.</p><ul><li><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"></path></svg> Free initial consultation</li><li><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"></path></svg> Custom solution and quotation</li><li><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"></path></svg> End-to-end event support</li></ul></div><div class="contact-options" aria-label="Contact VirtualPortal"><a class="contact-option whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/919904111866" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="contact-option-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 11.5a8.5 8.5 0 0 1-12.6 7.45L3 20.5l1.55-5.25A8.5 8.5 0 1 1 21 11.5Z"/><path d="M8.1 7.9c.3-.65.62-.67.93-.68h.8c.2 0 .42.08.54.42l.72 1.75c.1.28.06.5-.12.72l-.55.66c-.18.2-.14.4-.04.58.47.81 1.18 1.52 2 1.98.18.1.38.14.58-.04l.7-.62c.2-.18.43-.23.7-.12l1.7.8c.28.13.39.34.34.61-.14.78-.6 1.5-1.31 1.79-.66.27-1.52.3-2.78-.23-1.24-.52-2.47-1.34-3.48-2.35-1.01-1-1.82-2.23-2.34-3.47-.53-1.26-.5-2.13-.23-2.8Z"/></svg></span><span><small>WHATSAPP US</small><strong>+91 99041 11866</strong><em>Start a conversation with our event team</em></span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a><a class="contact-option email" href="mailto:info@evoqraeventsmedia.com"><span class="contact-option-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="